<title>HONG KONG: Nam Fong debuts at HK$3.80 per share.</title>
<headline>Nam Fong debuts at HK$3.80 per share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of China property group Nam Fong International Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$3.80 per share in Hong Kong on Monday, compared with their issue price of HK$2.88 per share.  </p>
<p>Nam Fong offered 340 million new shares -- 272 million to private and institutional investors and 68 million to the public. The initial public offering was 165.6 times subscribed.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds of the issue would be used to invest in development projects in Guangzhou in China's southern Guangdong province.</p>
<p>Nam Fong holds 10 development and two investment properties in Guangdong province as well as the rights to manage and lease two additional properties.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
